      "heading": "Welcome",
      "body": "In this first lesson you will learn how to greet people in Punjabi and say goodbye politely. Punjabi is usually written in the Gurmukhi script — you do not need to read it yet. Every Punjabi word also comes with a romanised spelling so you can start speaking right away."
